    "Invalid calls remain in primary totals; valid-only diagnostic does not establish numerical acceptance. Per-set aggregate ratios do not establish a per-draw10% bound.",
    "Only representative maxima, not trained integration maxima. No full GL normalization, variance, bounded-weight, or integration gain claim.",
    "Report quantiles follow the driver: sorted values at ceil((N-1)*q). All saved state hashes match within and across both runs."
